    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Fallen is a remake of a game released 13 years ago. In addition to the remake, it also brings a continuation of the plot, changing some aspects of the game, such as gameplay and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in a well-known village and the objective is to solve all the tasks and stay alive to tell the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each gameplay will have items scattered randomly, with the essential task of exploring drawers, cabinets and other interactive objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will be equipped with a flashlight that can be used to illuminate dark areas and remove shadow barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flashlight uses batteries that must be found and managed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village contains 6 missions, where each mission will be revealed based on cards that indicate their resolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village is haunted, so the player can hide in cabinets, barrels and under beds to avoid confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confrontation may be unavoidable, the flashlight can help you escape by using overcharging but this will also drain the battery faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can light candles and hold some of them to help provide light.</p>",
